        "subheading_3": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>For ten years Owen was the person who volunteered to make the slides so someone else would have to present them. Then a job made him speak every week, and he started writing down what actually helped.</p><p>He now runs small speaking workshops for teams and first time conference speakers, and writes a short letter about talks every other week. This is sample text. Replace it with your own story.</p>"
